message: >
  If you use phoskintime in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata in this file.
title: "phoskintime: ODE-based modeling of phosphorylation kinetics and transcriptional time-series"
authors:
  - family-names: Mishra
    given-names: Abhinav
    email: mishraabhinav36@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/bibymaths/phoskintime"
url: "https://bibymaths.github.io/phoskintime"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "0.4.0"
keywords:
  - phosphorylation
  - kinetics
  - ODE modeling
  - parameter estimation
  - optimization
  - sensitivity analysis
  - systems biology
  - transcriptional dynamics
  - time-series
  - Python
type: software
abstract: >
  phoskintime is a research software package for ODE-based modeling of
  phosphorylation kinetics and transcriptional time-series. It provides
  tools for parameter estimation, multi-objective optimization, sensitivity
  analysis, and network-level modeling in a systems biology context.
